{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17132","headline":"青云干吕 一 · 彭伉","name":"青云干吕 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祥辉上干吕，郁郁又纷纷。\n远示无爲化，将明至道君。\n势凝千里静，色向九霄分。\n已见从龙意，宁知触石文。\n状烟殊散漫，捧日更氛氲。\n自使来宾国，西瞻仰瑞云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彭伉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}